Modes:
  LEARN    — learn MySQL fundamentals
  APPLY    — apply MySQL patterns to schema
  REVIEW   — review MySQL skills
  UPGRADE  — propose MySQL skill upgrade

Rules:
  [M1]  Use appropriate storage engines (InnoDB).
  [M2]  Use indexes for frequently queried columns.
  [M3]  Use transactions for data integrity.
  [M4]  Use EXPLAIN for query analysis.

